          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "fastīdium is a native Latin word; Lewis & Short compares fastus \"pride\", but the origin is not settled. English fastidious comes from fastīdiōsus, built on it."
            }
          ]
